eamid": "76561198090701312", "personaname": "Aatrax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheRealMrSkittles/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 8636, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6690, "last_played": 1780117066, "avatar": "368e18245ce8b655a47e673e6461999ec1137cb4"}, "language": "english", "review": "In Gunfire Reborn, gamers of all skill levels can have a good time running around shooting stuff, collecting scrolls and coins, upgrading/swapping out their weapons, and beating bosses. The higher difficulties offer a good challenge to those who want to get the best or fastest run possible. You can play solo but this game is definitely the most fun with friends, especially if you all communicate what loot you get and help each other create the best build possible. The developers have done a good job of releasing steady and well crafted content to keep the average gamer coming back every month or so. If Gunfire Reborn keeps on a steady incline, I can see the franchise growing into something huge. 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1669160678, "timestamp_updated": 1669160678, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "126101206", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986342488", "personaname": "Tiny", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thetiny/", "num_games_owned": 446, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 12939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8955, "last_played": 1761269846, "avatar": "187ca0093635e46ec62d877d3ca796b405e158fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun to play with friends", "timestamp_created": 1669160535, "timestamp_updated": 1669160535